@crew lindgren
// Writer (command: guests), batch 3b. Dr. Lindgren: delighted, fast, numbers; keeps looking out of the window.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Oh, hello! Lindgren, astrophysics. Have you seen it yet? The nebula? Go and look!
- Hi there. Sorry, I'm looking past you. There's a nebula behind your head.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {me}! It's brighter tonight. Twelve per cent. I measured. Twice.
== feel
? mood:high
- Seven years chasing nebulae. This one waited for me. I could cry. I might.   #warm
? mood:low
- Cloud of dust in front of my best view. Typical. Still beautiful.
== near
? deck:2
- The observatory! Dr. Sato lent me her best stool. I'm told that's a big deal.   #funny
? time:night
- Don't make me go to bed. It's out there right now, being enormous.   #funny
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I'm giving a talk in the observation room before I go. Come. There are charts.
